{"id":"a1-u04","level":"a1","order":4,"title":{"en":"Society","fr":"La société","es":"La sociedad","ar":"المجتمع"},"tip":{"en":"To talk about social issues, use cause and effect: 'unemployment leads to inequality' or 'as a result of the reform'. Keep a neutral tone.","fr":"Pour parler des problèmes de société, employez la cause et la conséquence : « le chômage entraîne des inégalités » ou « à la suite de la réforme ». Gardez un ton neutre.","es":"Para hablar de problemas sociales, usa la causa y el efecto: «el desempleo provoca desigualdad» o «a raíz de la reforma». Mantén un tono neutro.","ar":"للحديث عن القضايا الاجتماعية استعمل السبب والنتيجة: «تؤدي البطالة إلى اللامساواة» أو «نتيجة للإصلاح». حافظ على نبرة محايدة."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a1-u04-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"gouvernement, parlement, loi","fr":"gobierno, parlamento, ley","es":"حكومة, برلمان, قانون","ar":"ḥukūma، barlamān، qānūn"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u04-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"vote, citoyen, démocratie","fr":"voto, ciudadano, democracia","es":"تصويت, مواطن, ديمقراطية","ar":"taṣwīt، muwāṭin، dīmuqrāṭiyya"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"justice, égalité, inégalité","fr":"justicia, igualdad, desigualdad","es":"عدالة, مساواة, لامساواة","ar":"ʿadāla، musāwāt، lā-musāwāt"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u04-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"protection sociale, éducation, santé publique","fr":"bienestar social, educación, sanidad","es":"رعاية اجتماعية, تعليم, رعاية صحية","ar":"riʿāya ijtimāʿiyya، taʿlīm، riʿāya ṣiḥḥiyya"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"intégration, discrimination, préjugé","fr":"integración, discriminación, prejuicio","es":"اندماج, تمييز, حكم مسبق","ar":"indimāj، tamyīz، ḥukm musbaq"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u04-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"solidarité, bénévole, association caritative","fr":"solidaridad, voluntario, organización benéfica","es":"تضامن, متطوع, جمعية خيرية","ar":"taḍāmun، mutaṭawwiʿ، jamʿiyya khayriyya"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"manifestation, réforme, politique publique","fr":"protesta, reforma, política pública","es":"احتجاج, إصلاح, سياسة عامة","ar":"iḥtijāj، iṣlāḥ، siyāsa ʿāmma"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u04-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"génération, fossé, urbanisation","fr":"generación, brecha, urbanización","es":"جيل, فجوة, تمدّن","ar":"jīl، fajwa، tamaddun"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l9","type":"learn","order":9,"title":{"en":"élire, manifester, réformer","fr":"elegir, protestar, reformar","es":"ينتخب, يحتج, يصلح","ar":"yantakhib، yaḥtajj، yuṣliḥ"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l10","type":"learn","order":10,"title":{"en":"intégrer, équitable, vulnérable","fr":"integrar, equitativo, vulnerable","es":"يدمج, منصف, هشّ","ar":"yadmuj، munṣif، hashsh"},"count":9},{"id":"a1-u04-l11","type":"story","order":11,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u04-l12","type":"review","order":12,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
